FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-judgment.

OFF THE RECORD: the sentence from the bed. A case that commenced a
OFF THE RECORD: child may enter judgment against it: a verdict served
OFF THE RECORD: from outside, on file the moment the sentencing step
OFF THE RECORD: commits, learned of at the condemned's next step.
OFF THE RECORD: Jurisdiction is parental and strict; only the case
OFF THE RECORD: that commenced him, and only once, verdicts being
OFF THE RECORD: final. Georg sleeps in two-day adjournments and never
OFF THE RECORD: takes the step that ends him; his standing turns all
OFF THE RECORD: the same.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT charter IS
        "FORM K-1. IN THE MATTER OF: georg. ARTICLE 1. ADJOURN FOR 2 DAYS. REFER TO ARTICLE 1.".
    COMMENCE PROCEEDINGS UPON charter, FILED UNDER georg.
    PROCLAIM THE STANDING OF georg.

ARTICLE 2.
    ENTER JUDGMENT AGAINST georg,
        ON THE GROUNDS OF "an innocent child, yes, that you truly were, but more truly still you were a devilish human being".
    PROCLAIM THE STANDING OF georg.
    PROCLAIM "at that moment an unending stream of traffic was going over the bridge".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
